00:00:31.734 --> 00:00:32.968
We'll get you one.

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:34.234
You can vote for all of these.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:35.934
You can vote for none of them,
whatever you want,

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.601
and we'll see the results live.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.434
Higgins, Roots,
you have clickers?

00:00:39.434 --> 00:00:40.634
-Got it.
-Roots, you have clickers?

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:41.968
-Alright. Very good.

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:43.567
Whatever post gets
the most likes,

00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:45.567
we will post it out
live on the show

00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:48.634
so you can all like it
and we can "wepost" it.

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:50.834
It's like a shared experience.
